th dissonant strings, low pressure tones, sparse impacts and long controlled silence.","Indie Film":"Understated indie-film score with felt piano, soft guitar, subtle percussion and an intimate unresolved warmth.","Jazz Lounge":"Refined lounge jazz with brushed drums, upright bass, restrained piano and no vocals.","Latin Percussion":"Upbeat Latin-influenced instrumental with hand percussion, warm bass, light guitar and no vocals.","Lo-Fi Beat":"Relaxed lo-fi instrumental around 82 BPM with dusty drums, mellow keys, soft bass and subtle vinyl texture.","Luxury Minimal":"Slow luxury-minimal score with sparse piano, deep soft bass, subtle strings and generous negative space.","Meditative":"Slow meditative sound bed with sustained bowls, soft drones, breath-like texture and no rhythmic pulse or vocals.","No Music":"N/A","Piano Emotional":"Intimate solo-piano theme at a slow tempo with natural dynamics and no additional vocals.","Premium Ambient":"Restrained premium ambient score with soft synth pads, sparse piano accents, low pulse and no vocals.","Rock Energy":"Energetic instrumental rock with tight drums, controlled electric guitars, supportive bass and no vocals.","Sports Energy":"Driving sports instrumental around 125 BPM with tight percussion, pulsing bass, bold synth rhythm and no vocals.","Suspense Pulse":"Low suspense pulse with muted percussion, sub-bass movement, sparse high textures and no melodic resolution until the end.","Synthwave":"Retro synthwave instrumental with analog arpeggios, gated drums, warm pads and a steady driving pulse.","Trap Instrumental":"Controlled trap instrumental with crisp hi-hats, deep sub-bass, sparse melodic texture and no vocals.","Tropical House":"Light tropical-house instrumental around 108 BPM with soft kick, marimba-like plucks, warm bass and no vocals.","Upbeat Pop Instrumental":"Bright upbeat pop instrumental around 115 BPM with crisp drums, warm bass, light guitar and no vocals."}
